          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "going. Our recent success has been a learning experience"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          326.9797841448932,
          355.9869255882353,
          12.10645516627062
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "for us. It created a unique set of values and skills, and these"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          343.53556710213786,
          335.66994407563027,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "are not going to disappear. Moreover, the core skills that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          360.09136223277915,
          345.3342125630252,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "now exist in Nissan are what will drive us forward. And we"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          376.64715736342055,
          350.8136041596639,
          12.106442992874008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "will not lose these skills because we now attract and retain"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          393.2029403206651,
          351.30999701680673,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "the best employees. The organization is more efficient, and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
