      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          326.9797841448932,
          309.1575542016807,
          12.10645516627062
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "is about making a specific brand decision. You can’t"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          343.53556710213786,
          347.1513928571429,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "advertise a luxury brand like this in the same way you do a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          360.09136223277915,
          327.320605882353,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "standard non-luxury brand. The typical Infiniti customer"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          376.64715736342055,
          328.2562844537815,
          12.106442992874008
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "might never buy a Nissan, for example, because it’s not"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          393.2029403206651,
          345.903855882353,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "exclusive enough. So in the Planning Group, we have a lot"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          409.75877197149646,
          276.88910714285714,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of work to do upstream, going deep into brand"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          426.3145914489312,
          337.77266008403353,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "understanding and then deploying this understanding on"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          442.87042309976255,
          333.34023277310916,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "specific products, features that span across multiple car"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          459.4262547505939,
          312.57375,
          12.106442992874008
