          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "onward, they now have the confidence to make strong"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          624.9845225653207,
          340.73049827731097,
          12.106442992874065
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "projections about how many customers a model will have"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          641.5403420427554,
          353.87099827731095,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "around the world. Their mindset is, we’ve succeeded before"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          658.0961736935867,
          322.5001583613446,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "with Murano and others, so why not try this again on a"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          674.6519931710213,
          359.4235869327732,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "global basis? They can identify and target certain customers"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          691.2078248218527,
          322.45621256302525,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "but then propose skipping a particular market to avoid"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          707.763656472684,
          339.93828525210085,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "compromising the concept. We don’t want to make bland"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          724.3194759501188,
          353.31605121848736,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "cars, where we design one variation for Europe, another for"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          740.8753076009501,
          337.7038713865546,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Japan, and something else for the US. There is no flavor,"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          757.4311392517815,
          348.6596226470589,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "nothing special, about a chameleon car that tries to please"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          773.9869587292162,
          335.8266054201681,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "everyone. The Murano was the kind of strong, innovative"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          790.5427903800476,
          346.16442810924366,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "concept that prospered because it was not a compromise."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          146.49644193277314,
          807.0986098574822,
          314.6193950420168,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "These are the things that we as planners can do. For"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          823.6544415083135,
          359.877498277311,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "instance, if we understand that in one market diesel engines"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          840.2102731591449,
          356.63997978991597,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "are very important, the engineers can create a package that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          856.7660926365795,
          322.8500881932773,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "takes that into account. We are not compromising, but"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          873.3218999406176,
          348.30528273109246,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "creating the proper combination to address specific needs"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          889.8777194180523,
          353.3086953361345,
          12.106442992874108
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "from the start. With a car like the Z, for instance, we will not"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          906.4335388954869,
          346.79708567226896,
          12.106441775534435
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "compromise. We will make a clear choice, even if it means"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          922.9893559382423,
          359.49676676470585,
          12.106442992874108
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "losing some volume in other markets. Cars like the Z are not"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          122.08094710084035,
          939.5451741983372,
          244.3028911344538,
          12.10644177553445
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "volume seekers; they are brand builders. "
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.0380537815126,
          840.2102731591449,
          312.11396428571436,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Here in the Planning Group, we understand that we"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          856.7660926365795,
          341.1844457983193,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "must protect the Nissan way of being creative. But while"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          873.3218999406176,
          357.2388571428571,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "fostering that creativity, we will continue to standardize and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          889.8777194180523,
          360.1147315126051,
          12.106442992874108
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "refine our processes, building on what we have learned and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          906.4335388954869,
          352.50041134453784,
          12.106441775534435
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "applying these processes during this period of sustainable"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          922.9893559382423,
          328.78483991596636,
          12.106442992874108
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "growth and profit. That balance between creativity and"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          939.5451741983372,
          360.5715197478992,
          12.10644177553445
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "rigorous process management will keep Nissan on the path"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          956.1009912410926,
          166.32971302521003,
          12.1064429928741
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "of global profitable growth.”"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.0380537815126,
          608.4286909144894,
          264.7340714285714,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Like the global expansion of Infiniti, our Light"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          624.9845225653207,
          323.4065357142857,
          12.106442992874065
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Commercial Vehicles (LCV) business presents another"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          641.5403420427554,
          326.686587394958,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "breakthrough opportunity during the NISSAN Value-Up"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          658.0961736935867,
          346.245,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "period. In the past, Nissan, like other OEM producers, often"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          674.6519931710213,
          346.168874369748,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "placed the LCV business behind other product lines. Some"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          691.2078248218527,
          335.19403571428575,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "view these vehicles as unprofitable, but that is only true if"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          707.763656472684,
          354.0804273109244,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "they fail to address customer needs. We are now committed"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          724.3194759501188,
          342.1113386554622,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "to bringing LCVs in-line with Nissan’s other product areas."
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          740.8753076009501,
          352.2105344537815,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We are looking to introduce a new generation of LCVs, with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          757.4311392517815,
          360.41339411764704,
          12.106430819477453
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "innovations and features that will satisfy customer needs that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          773.9869587292162,
          339.1109827731092,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "have not yet been met. From a design standpoint, we also"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          790.5427903800476,
          355.24012436974795,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "want to demonstrate that LCVs are more than just utilitarian."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          807.0986098574822,
          344.42048277310926,
          12.106442992874122
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "We have several exciting products in the LCV pipeline that"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          823.6544415083135,
          292.93032268907564,
          12.106430819477424
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "will bring something new and fresh to this market."
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "bbox": [
          542.0380537815126,
          475.9820742280285,
          322.2951600840337,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Brand is about consistency; keeping on track, building"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          492.5379058788599,
          305.60960714285716,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "step-by-step to sharpen the awareness that we are"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          509.0937253562945,
          349.9789457983193,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "professionals with finely tuned cars meant for very specific"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          525.6495570071258,
          346.44998277310924,
          12.106455166270791
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "customers. For example, in the recent launch of the Infiniti"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          542.2053886579572,
          357.1100172268907,
          12.106442992874065
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "brand in Korea, everything in support of the brand had to be"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          558.7612081353919,
          331.9286613445378,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "outstanding from the beginning—the sales network, the"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          575.3170397862233,
          336.48848151260506,
          12.106455166270848
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "service, the people. We are going to do great things with"
      },
      {
        "bbox": [
          517.6225365546219,
          591.872859263658,
          350.1868226890756,
          12.106455166270734
        ],
        "font": {
          "color": [
            0,
            0,
            0,
            255
          ],
          "name": "/MENEIG+NissanAG-Light",
          "size": 1.0
        },
        "text": "Infiniti as we take the brand global over the next five years."
      }
    ],
